// Generated Russia faction names and tooltips.

INI:FactionRussia
"Russia"
END

SIDE:Russia
"Russia"
END

TOOLTIP:BioStrategyLong_Russia
"Subtlety has left the factory. Open the fight with overwhelming artillery salvos, then send in the armour. Concentrated fire is devastating, but long reload windows leave artillery vulnerable. Tanks and infantry must cover the gaps."
END

GUI:BioFeatures_Russia
"Heavy armour, oversized firepower, explosive salvos, long reloads"
END

OBJECT:Russia_Tigr
"Tigr Radar Scout"
END

CONTROLBAR:Russia_ConstructTigr
"Tigr Radar Scout"
END

CONTROLBAR:Russia_DescriptionTigr
"Light radar scout. Detects hidden enemies nearby. Nearby enemy artillery fire triggers a brief approximate radar contact, at most once every twelve seconds. Weak machine gun; no passengers."
END

OBJECT:Russia_T90
"T-90"
END

CONTROLBAR:Russia_ConstructT90
"T-90"
END

CONTROLBAR:Russia_DescriptionT90
"Affordable assault tank. One powerful shell followed by a slow reload. Sluggish movement and turret handling leave it vulnerable to kiting."
END

OBJECT:Russia_BMP3
"BMPT Assault Support"
END

CONTROLBAR:Russia_ConstructBMP3
"BMPT Assault Support"
END

CONTROLBAR:Russia_DescriptionBMP3
"Armoured infantry escort. Twin autocannons cut down exposed infantry and light vehicles. Cannot clear garrisons; bring assault engineers for buildings. No passengers, anti-air or anti-tank missiles."
END

OBJECT:Russia_Tunguska
"Tunguska"
END

CONTROLBAR:Russia_ConstructTunguska
"Tunguska"
END

CONTROLBAR:Russia_DescriptionTunguska
"Burst air defence. Four heavy anti-air missiles fire rapidly, followed by a six-second reload. Short-range cannon provides limited self-defence; ineffective against tanks."
END

OBJECT:Russia_Msta
"Msta-S"
END

CONTROLBAR:Russia_ConstructMsta
"Msta-S"
END

CONTROLBAR:Russia_DescriptionMsta
"Heavy siege howitzer. Automatically sets up to fire a powerful shell, then reloads for six seconds. Inaccurate against moving targets and vulnerable up close."
END

OBJECT:Russia_TOS
"TOS-1A"
END

CONTROLBAR:Russia_ConstructTOS
"TOS-1A"
END

CONTROLBAR:Russia_DescriptionTOS
"Short-range assault launcher. Eight unguided rockets saturate a target area, followed by ten seconds reloading. Must close dangerously near the enemy."
END

